  "title": "哥伦比亚 - 安蒂奥基亚 Caturra Chiroso 水洗 - 好多莓果、葡萄柚、薰衣草、红糖、红茶感、酸感非常扎实",
  "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mVmdIDJ83H28q0E1JTJ_ag",
  "publish_time": 1669449723,
  "status": "body_recovered",
  "extraction_method": "article_dom",
  "body_text": "基本资料\n庄园名称：\n裙子 La Falda\n庄园主/种植者：Santiago de Jesus Caro\n海拔高度：\n1944-1980米\n产区： 安蒂奥基亚-乌劳镇 Antioquia-\nUrrao\n产季：\n2月-5月（7\n0\n%），\n10月-12月（30%\n）\n品种：卡杜拉奇罗索 Caturra Chiroso\n处理方式：水洗 Washed\n采收：2022年3月\n到港：2022年11月\n烘焙度：\n浅度 Light Roasted\n风味：好多莓果、葡萄柚、薰衣草、红糖、红茶感、酸感非常扎实\nBerries a lot, Grapefruit, Lavender, Brown sugar, Black-tea like, Tart\n关于 La Falda与Chiroso品种\nSantiago Caro出生在安蒂奥基亚乌劳镇的一个普通咖啡农家庭，他从小就和咖啡结缘。他的父亲Jose Arcadio Rueda已经在La Falda庄园种植了16年咖啡，庄园共种有9500棵Caturra变种（当地称为Caturro Chiroso，即卡杜拉奇罗索）。\nAntioquia位于图中棕黄色区域\n2013年，裙子庄园在哥伦比亚CoE卓越杯竞赛中获得了第七的名字，这也是\nAntioquia省第一次进入该项赛事的前10名\n。\n这次获奖，不仅对这个咖农家庭努力的认可，更是对Antioquia省精品咖啡取得划时代的意义。\n卡杜拉奇罗索正式获得咖啡界关注也正是在2014年的哥伦比亚南部卓越杯，当年的冠军豆种即为卡杜拉奇罗索，这支豆种几乎只有在Urrao镇有种植，历史已有30余年，目前广泛认为它是卡杜拉的自然变种，豆形较为尖长，有明显的花香和水果调性，复杂的酸质。目前World Coffee Research正在对这个品种进行基因测序分析。\n由于种种原因造成的微气候，使乌劳镇成为颇为特殊的咖啡产区。咖啡可以在海拔高的地方种植，从1800到2100米分布有很多小型咖啡庄园，有规律的降雨使咖啡几乎全年都可以处在理想的生长温度区间。在乌劳镇的许多农场中也发现了Caturra Chiroso。这个品种最开始在相邻的庄园间零星传播，后来有几位咖农开始专门在庄园里种植此品种。与哥伦比亚其他产区相比，乌劳镇的庄园水洗发酵时间往往较久，有一部分原因是由于天气寒冷和降水丰富，而且因为咖农常常会在几天的时间里加入不同采摘批次，每天会换掉水避免过度发酵。\n老庄园主 Jose Arcadio Caro Rueda\n庄园主 Santiago de Jesus Caro\n庄园获奖记录\n2013年哥伦比亚卓越杯第7名；2021年哥伦比亚卓越杯第15名\n众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content defaultNoSetting\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPJPDrFLmNx841rUDpBwNVxCPVXYTf5yaKJIza9iaP6oRMWdpoFFDRbuA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           基本资料\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           庄园名称：\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           裙子 La Falda\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          庄园主/种植者：Santiago de Jesus Caro\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          海拔高度：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          1944-1980米\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          产区： 安蒂奥基亚-乌劳镇 Antioquia-\n          <span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           Urrao\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          产季：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          2月-5月（7\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          0\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          %），\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          10月-12月（30%\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          ）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          品种：卡杜拉奇罗索 Caturra Chiroso\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          处理方式：水洗 Washed\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          采收：2022年3月\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          到港：2022年11月\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          烘焙度：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n<br/>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          风味：好多莓果、葡萄柚、薰衣草、红糖、红茶感、酸感非常扎实\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Berries a lot, Grapefruit, Lavender, Brown sugar, Black-tea like, Tart\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPYO88lv51QsY85NFr32LBdJowho3ibzm7dyRuy4vZIkdchsX7hd07Cjw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 820px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           关于 La Falda与Chiroso品种\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Santiago Caro出生在安蒂奥基亚乌劳镇的一个普通咖啡农家庭，他从小就和咖啡结缘。他的父亲Jose Arcadio Rueda已经在La Falda庄园种植了16年咖啡，庄园共种有9500棵Caturra变种（当地称为Caturro Chiroso，即卡杜拉奇罗索）。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TAWWsbN3mr1FLZttGiavtib4yTF4pjQYW9PP6RnwcvH1mibJmJicBoSGVdyDibqR46cJ9NjN0Rq3Cflmg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(214, 214, 214);\">\n          Antioquia位于图中棕黄色区域\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(214, 214, 214);\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          2013年，裙子庄园在哥伦比亚CoE卓越杯竞赛中获得了第七的名字，这也是\n          <span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           Antioquia省第一次进入该项赛事的前10名\n          </span>\n          。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          这次获奖，不仅对这个咖农家庭努力的认可，更是对Antioquia省精品咖啡取得划时代的意义。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPsW5bnq3qPO4zQNPyMqhnY1jp14zoych2gRgZslugIbggV0qXj9HWLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          卡杜拉奇罗索正式获得咖啡界关注也正是在2014年的哥伦比亚南部卓越杯，当年的冠军豆种即为卡杜拉奇罗索，这支豆种几乎只有在Urrao镇有种植，历史已有30余年，目前广泛认为它是卡杜拉的自然变种，豆形较为尖长，有明显的花香和水果调性，复杂的酸质。目前World Coffee Research正在对这个品种进行基因测序分析。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPNIBpotg7BS8UgWA3bebqFpiaFCB6m70V3jkDFUQTkrMck5icicU0Mteeg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;width: 578px;height: 606px;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          由于种种原因造成的微气候，使乌劳镇成为颇为特殊的咖啡产区。咖啡可以在海拔高的地方种植，从1800到2100米分布有很多小型咖啡庄园，有规律的降雨使咖啡几乎全年都可以处在理想的生长温度区间。在乌劳镇的许多农场中也发现了Caturra Chiroso。这个品种最开始在相邻的庄园间零星传播，后来有几位咖农开始专门在庄园里种植此品种。与哥伦比亚其他产区相比，乌劳镇的庄园水洗发酵时间往往较久，有一部分原因是由于天气寒冷和降水丰富，而且因为咖农常常会在几天的时间里加入不同采摘批次，每天会换掉水避免过度发酵。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZxiblyl1ZOx5zicfbIo0dTswohskG1rEbS2KwszrCiaeWIY3suiaWaiaPUSCQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          老庄园主 Jose Arcadio Caro Rueda\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZxU6LJIO56uhicgd13g7QiboibQEoCLAaAQP8G0UT9cqk4CVLwED2Prpiamw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"text-align: center;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          庄园主 Santiago de Jesus Caro\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           庄园获奖记录\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          2013年哥伦比亚卓越杯第7名；2021年哥伦比亚卓越杯第15名\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"height: 165px;width: 388px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
